      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>In the name of God, the merciful and compassionate.</li>\n<li>The amount owed by Bas\u1e6diyya ibn Marq\u016bra for the tax-farm</li>\n<li>of the fallow fertile lands of Dayq\u016bf, in the province of al-Bahnas\u0101,&nbsp;</li>\n<li>this being administered as the property of the office of the noble lady</li>\n<li>of al-\u02be\u0100mir in the Mu\u1e25awwil chamber, upon her be the most excellent peace,&nbsp;</li>\n<li>for the kar\u0101j\u012b year five-hundred and fifty.</li>\n<li>Produce: two hundred irdabbs.</li>\n<li>Wheat: One hundred and thirty-three irdabbs. Barley:</li>\n<li>Sixty-six irdabbs.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
